# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person, open_place, child, retired, of_age, organisation, amended, ward
    LIST People: PERSONS WITH knows, friend, pointer, member, listed, message, posted, group_delivered, group_message, points_to, item, delivered, item_from, has_parent, creator, parent, forwarded_broadcast, broadcast_from, has_officer, officer, first_officer, role, has_role, participant, has_participant, founder, vote, village_emergency, village_emergency_with, notice, notice_with OPENS Person
    LIST Leader: "Alice is the leader of Grupo"
    LIST Broadcast: "Alice holds the broadcast Cast"
    LIST Proposed: "Alice has Motion proposed"
    LIST Taken: "Alice has Motion taken"
    LIST Made broadcast: "Alice has made the broadcast Call"
    LIST Personal emergency: "Alice has broadcast the personal emergency Call"
    LIST Village emergency of: "Alice has the village emergency Cast"
    LIST Resolved: "Alice has resolved Call by Reply"
    LIST Emergency answer: "Alice has answered Call by Reply"
    LIST Notice of: "Alice has the notice Cast"
    LIST Has guardian: "Alice has Y2 as a guardian"
    LIST Guardian: "Alice is a guardian of X2"
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM knows
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends, Bob FROM knows
    Person unfriend: Bob FROM friend
    Open place: Alice may declare her place open
    Close place: Alice may close her place
    Encounter: Bob TYPED
    Message: Alice may send Text to Bob, Bob FROM friend, Text TYPED
    Create: Alice may create Grupo, Grupo TYPED
    Close: Alice may close Grupo by leaving it, Grupo FROM leader
    Join: Alice may add Bob to Grupo, Bob FROM friend, Grupo FROM leader
    Remove: Alice may end Bob's membership in Grupo, Bob FROM listed, Grupo FROM leader
    Leave: Alice may end her membership in Bob's Grupo, Bob FROM member, Grupo FROM member
    Post: Alice may send Text to the group Grupo of Bob, Bob FROM member, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member
    Post own: Alice may send Text to the group Grupo of Alice, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member
    Point friend: Alice may point to Bob, Bob FROM friend
    Point transitive: Alice may point to Carol, Bob FROM points_to, Carol FROM knows
    Unpoint: Alice may cease pointing to Bob, Bob FROM points_to
    Labeled point friend: Alice may add a Dave-pointer to Bob, Bob FROM friend, Dave TYPED, Erin TYPED
    Labeled point transitive: Alice may add a Dave-pointer to Carol, Bob FROM pointer, Carol FROM knows, Dave FROM pointer
    Labeled point transitive friend: Alice may add a Dave-pointer to Carol, Bob FROM friend, Carol FROM knows, Dave TYPED
    Labeled unpoint: Alice may remove her Dave-pointer to Carol, Carol FROM pointer, Dave FROM pointer
    Labeled unpoint self: Alice may remove her Dave-pointer to Dave, Dave FROM pointer
    Post: Alice may post Item to her feed, Item TYPED
    Enter: Alice may create Wendy, and Wendy must consent, Wendy TYPED
    Make parent: Wendy TYPED, Decider FROM friend, Codecider TYPED
    Resign: Alice may end her guardianship of Wendy, Wendy FROM parent
    End parent: Bob TYPED, Wendy FROM parent, Codecider TYPED
    Parent unfriend: Wendy FROM friend
    Child acquaint: Bob TYPED, Alice FROM has_parent
    Child befriend: Bob FROM knows, Alice FROM has_parent
    Child end: Bob FROM friend, G1 FROM has_parent
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Wendy, Wendy FROM friend
    Child unfriend: Wendy TYPED, Bob TYPED
    Children acquaint: Will TYPED, Alice FROM has_parent, Bob TYPED
    Children befriend: Will FROM knows, Alice FROM has_parent, Bob TYPED
    Children of one parent befriend: Will FROM knows, Alice FROM has_parent
    Retire: Those who decide for Wendy may retire Wendy, Wendy FROM parent, Codecider TYPED
    Child message: Bob FROM friend, G1 FROM has_parent, Text TYPED
    Child post: Alice FROM member, G1 FROM has_parent, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member
    Child post own: G1 FROM has_parent, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member
    Child create: Alice FROM has_parent, Grupo TYPED
    Child close: G1 FROM has_parent, Grupo FROM leader
    Parent close: Wendy FROM parent, Grupo TYPED
    Child join: Wendy FROM friend, Alice FROM friend, G1 TYPED, Grupo FROM leader
    Children join: Will FROM friend, Alice FROM has_parent, Bob TYPED, Grupo FROM leader
    Children of one parent join: Will FROM friend, Alice FROM has_parent, Grupo FROM leader
    Child withdraw: Wendy FROM parent, Bob TYPED, Grupo TYPED
    Child add: Will FROM friend, Alice FROM has_parent, Bob TYPED, Grupo FROM leader
    Child leave: Alice FROM member, G1 FROM has_parent, Grupo FROM member
    Child remove: Bob FROM listed, G1 FROM has_parent, Grupo FROM leader
    Of age: Alice may declare Wendy of age, Wendy FROM creator, Bob TYPED
    Found: Orga TYPED, Role TYPED
    Appoint: Orga FROM participant, Decider FROM friend, Codecider TYPED, Role TYPED
    Resign: Alice may end her guardianship of Orga, Orga FROM officer
    End officer: Bob TYPED, Orga FROM officer, Codecider TYPED
    Officer unfriend: Orga FROM friend
    Organisation acquaint: Bob TYPED, Alice FROM has_officer
    Organisation befriend: Bob FROM knows, Alice FROM has_officer
    Organisation end: Bob FROM friend, G2 FROM has_officer
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Orga, Orga FROM friend
    Organisation unfriend: Orga TYPED, Bob TYPED
    Organisations acquaint: Will TYPED, Alice FROM has_officer, Bob TYPED
    Organisations befriend: Will FROM knows, Alice FROM has_officer, Bob TYPED
    Organisations of one officer befriend: Will FROM knows, Alice FROM has_officer
    Retire: Those who decide for Orga may retire Orga, Orga FROM officer, Codecider TYPED
    Found by an organisation: Alice may found Orga with Gov in the role Role, Orga TYPED, Gov TYPED, G2 TYPED, Role TYPED
    Propose: Alice may propose Motion in Orga, Orga FROM officer, Motion TYPED
    Vote: Alice may vote on Motion in Orga, Orga FROM participant, Motion TYPED
    Act: Alice may take Motion for Orga, Orga FROM officer, Motion TYPED
    Join: Alice may become a participant of Orga, Orga TYPED, Decider TYPED, Codecider TYPED
    Leave: Alice may end her participation in Orga, Orga FROM participant
    Officer leave: Alice may end her participation and her office in Orga, Orga FROM participant
    Expel: Those who expel participants of Orga may end Bob's participation in Orga, Bob TYPED, Orga FROM officer, Codecider TYPED
    Officer expel: Those who expel participants of Orga may end Bob's participation and Bob's office in Orga, Bob TYPED, Orga FROM officer, Codecider TYPED
    Amend: Alice may amend the bylaws of Orga as Motion says, Orga FROM officer, Motion TYPED
    Personal emergency: Alice may broadcast Call as a personal emergency, Call TYPED
    Village emergency: Alice may broadcast Cast as a village emergency of Orga, Orga FROM officer, Cast TYPED
    Emergency forward: Alice may forward the village emergency Cast to Bob in Orga, Bob TYPED, Orga TYPED, Cast FROM broadcast
    Resolve: Alice may broadcast Reply as the resolution of Call, Reply TYPED, Call FROM personal_emergency
    Answer: Alice may broadcast Reply as an answer to Call, Reply TYPED, Call FROM broadcast
    Notice: Alice may broadcast Cast as a notice of Orga, Orga FROM officer, Cast TYPED
    Notice forward: Alice may forward the notice Cast to Bob in Orga, Bob TYPED, Orga TYPED, Cast FROM broadcast

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend, pointer, member, listed, message, posted, group_delivered, group_message, points_to, item, delivered, item_from, has_parent, creator, parent, forwarded_broadcast, broadcast_from, has_officer, officer, first_officer, role, has_role, participant, has_participant, founder, vote, village_emergency, village_emergency_with, notice, notice_with
